@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontColor #14243A
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowColor #607590
skinparam roundCorner 9
title Stavy misie
hide empty description
state "Aktívne stavy · UC5" as Active {
  state Submitted #EAF3FF
  state InProgress #EAF3FF
  state Cancelling #FFF5DA
  Submitted --> InProgress : jobQuery 20, 25, 50
  Submitted --> Cancelling : UC2 / jobQuery 28
  InProgress --> Cancelling : UC2 / jobQuery 28
}
state Failed #FDEBED
state Completed #E5F6ED
state Cancelled #EEF2F7
[*] --> Created : POST /api/missions
Created --> Submitted : submitMission OK
Created --> Cancelling : UC2
Created --> Failed : submitMission chyba
Active --> Completed : jobQuery [30, 35]
Active --> Cancelled : jobQuery [31]
Active --> Failed : jobQuery [60]
legend bottom right
  <b>Kódy a farby stavov</b>
Čísla v hranatých zátvorkách a pri jobQuery označujú kódy stavu jobu z KUKA FM.
Prehľad kódov je v tabuľke pod diagramom.
UC2 = zrušenie misie operátorom alebo externým systémom.
  |<#FFFFFF>    | Nový (Created) |
  |<#EAF3FF>    | Aktívny (Submitted, InProgress) |
  |<#FFF5DA>    | Rušenie (Cancelling) |
  |<#E5F6ED>    | Dokončené (Completed) |
  |<#FDEBED>    | Chyba (Failed) |
  |<#EEF2F7>    | Zrušené (Cancelled) |
endlegend
@enduml
